# A kick followed by a quit: when the three seconds run out the link is
# already quitting, so no JOIN goes out; the channel waits for the next
# connect.
= rejoin-on-kick on
! welcome
< :textual!u@h JOIN #c
> MODE #c
< :op!o@h KICK #c textual :bye
! disconnect
> QUIT
@ +3s
? quitting
? rejoin #c on-connect
@ wake
> hangup #1
? notice Disconnected: quit
? offline user-quit
